@startuml
!theme plain

' Chinese font support
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title AiEngine: temperature/top_k/rng 注入点重构

== 重构前 ==
participant "play_single_game" as Game
participant "AIEngine" as Engine

Game -> Engine: ① new AIEngine(model)
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: engine
deactivate Engine

Game -> Engine: ② engine.get_move(board, player,\n  strategy="sampling",\n  temperature=1.0, top_k=None, rng=rng)
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: MoveDecision
deactivate Engine

Game -> Engine: ③ engine.get_move(board, player)\n(无温度参数，走 argmax)
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: MoveDecision
deactivate Engine

note over Game, Engine: temperature/top_k/rng 每次调用时透传\n调用方需记住采样配置

== 重构后 ==
Game -> Engine: ① new AIEngine(model,\n  temperature=1.0, top_k=None, rng=rng)
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: engine
deactivate Engine

Game -> Engine: ② engine.get_move(board, player,\n  strategy="sampling")
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: MoveDecision
deactivate Engine

Game -> Engine: ③ engine.get_move(board, player)\n(默认 strategy="argmax")
activate Engine
Engine --> Game: MoveDecision
deactivate Engine

note over Game, Engine: temperature/top_k/rng 构造时一次性注入\n调用方无需重复传参

@enduml
